<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Did that get him?</font>

67
00:03:22,930 --> 00:03:23,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara...</font>

68
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:33,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doing all that work...
And managing just one blow, huh?</font>

69
00:03:34,110 --> 00:03:36,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Shut up!</font>

70
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He attacked the base of the tail
