71
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though I'm not wounded,
I can't absorb the impact.</font>

72
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:50,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did I underestimate him too much?</font>

73
