75
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And after you've rescued her...</font>

76
00:04:05,090 --> 00:04:07,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">take Sakura and
lose no time in fleeing.</font>

77
00:04:08,350 --> 00:04:09,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, if anyone, can do it!</font>

78
00:04:12,270 --> 00:04:14,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke... You...</font>

79
00:04:15,770 --> 00:04:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I still have the ability...
to hold him in check for a while.</font>

80
00:04:22,110 --> 00:04:23,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If things end here...</font>

81
00:04:24,490 --> 00:04:27,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it would just mean that
was the extent of the man I am.</font>

82
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:32,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I lost everything once...</font>

83
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:35,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to see...</font>

84
00:04:36,670 --> 00:04:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">any precious comrades die
right before my eyes again.</font>

85
00:04:41,460 --> 00:04:44,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Precious... comrades...</font>

86
00:04:45,590 --> 00:04:46,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not allow my comrades...</font>

87
00:04:47,970 --> 00:04:50,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to be killed, no matter what.</font>

88
00:04:56,270 --> 00:04:57,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

89
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

90
00:05:05,860 --> 00:05:07,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because he resembles me...</font>

91
00:05:07,910 --> 00:05:09,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because he has gone through life</font>

92
00:05:09,830 --> 00:05:12,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the same loneliness
and sadness as I have...</font>

93
00:05:12,910 --> 00:05:17,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy who continued to fight
in solitude for himself,</font>

94
00:05:17,710 --> 00:05:20,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought... he was strong.</font>

95
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

96
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that's not the meaning
of true strength...</font>

97
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:31,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If one fights just for
oneself in solitude...</font>

98
00:05:31,350 --> 00:05:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one can't really become strong...</font>

99
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there someone who
is precious to you?</font>

100
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:47,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When a person wants to protect
someone who is precious to him...</font>

101
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:55,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's then that they truly...
become... strong.</font>

102
00:06:00,590 --> 00:06:03,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will... become strong.</font>

103
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:15,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's releasing such
massive amount of Chakra!</font>

104
00:06:16,810 --> 00:06:19,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... Naruto?!</font>

105
00:06:21,310 --> 00:06:23,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what, I will...</font>

106
00:06:26,530 --> 00:06:28,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">protect you!</font>

107
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

108
00:06:50,050 --> 00:06:52,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's pretty good, this one.</font>

109
