<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, you get yourself
a good rest.</font>

117
00:07:22,710 --> 00:07:26,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave the rest to Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

118
