<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This guy...!</font>

130
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:42,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— This time, I'll use both legs...
— This time, I'll use both legs...</font>

131
00:08:42,540 --> 00:08:44,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— and go for a 4K Barrage!
— and go for a 4K Barrage!</font>

