00:08:45,710 --> 00:08:49,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell is that...?
Suddenly...</font>

133
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:53,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unbelievable...
To get Gaara in that state...</font>

134
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:56,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where does that strength come from?</font>

135
00:08:57,800 --> 00:09:01,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!
There's no way...</font>

136
00:09:04,100 --> 00:09:09,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way I'll... lose to... a guy like this...!</font>

137
00:09:21,410 --> 00:09:23,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's... that?</font>

138
00:09:30,710 --> 00:09:33,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It finally... emerged.</font>

139
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:51,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Perfect Possession!</font>

140
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:59,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...
the monster inside that guy.</font>

141
00:10:00,740 --> 00:10:06,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think you would
expose this form!</font>

142
00:10:11,630 --> 00:10:12,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

143
00:10:15,050 --> 00:10:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... my body...!</font>

144
00:10:19,010 --> 00:10:22,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My Chakra has...
with all those clones earlier on...</font>

145
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:29,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

146
00:10:30,060 --> 00:10:31,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Damn...!</font>

147
00:10:37,900 --> 00:10:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, Inu, Tori, Saru, Hitsuji...</font>

148
00:10:42,450 --> 00:10:44,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This will mark your end...</font>

149
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:47,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Sand Burial!
— Summoning Jutsu!</font>

150
00:10:55,590 --> 00:10:58,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's amazing that he can utilize
a Summoning Jutsu in that state...</font>

151
00:11:00,550 --> 00:11:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will protect...</font>

152
00:11:03,300 --> 00:11:04,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

153
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:19,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto...</font>

154
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:27,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You continue to give me
such pleasure...</font>

155
00:11:27,750 --> 00:11:31,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...
What in the... world...?</font>

156
00:11:32,670 --> 00:11:35,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My hours of practice
are finally paying off!</font>

157
00:11:36,050 --> 00:11:38,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can do it!</font>

158
00:11:38,510 --> 00:11:40,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What is this?
— Huh?</font>

159
00:11:40,970 --> 00:11:44,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not you again!
What in the world do you want?</font>

160
00:11:45,300 --> 00:11:46,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

161
00:11:50,730 --> 00:11:54,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That must be...
the Shukaku of the Sand.</font>

162
00:11:55,690 --> 00:11:59,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chief Toad!
Come join me in this fight!</font>

163
00:12:03,780 --> 00:12:04,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

164
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:06,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

165
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:10,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why would I go out of my way
and fight a guy like that?</font>

166
00:12:10,750 --> 00:12:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's idiotic!</font>

167
00:12:12,500 --> 00:12:13,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

168
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:16,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You told me the other day that you
would make me your henchman!</font>

169
00:12:17,170 --> 00:12:20,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's only natural for a chief
to help out his henchman!</font>

170
00:12:20,670 --> 00:12:22,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's respect and duty, right?!</font>

171
00:12:23,130 --> 00:12:26,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true I told you
I'd make you my henchman...</font>

172
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we haven't even exchanged
cups of sake to seal our relationship yet...</font>

173
00:12:32,060 --> 00:12:35,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gimme a break! I'm still underage!</font>

174
00:12:35,730 --> 00:12:37,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't drink alcohol!</font>

175
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:41,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say that and just listen
to what this guy says, Pop!</font>

176
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:43,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Pop?!</font>

177
00:12:43,860 --> 00:12:47,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you here, Gamakichi?</font>

178
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:50,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had lots of time on my hands,
so I came to visit...</font>

179
00:12:50,950 --> 00:12:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Huh?
You're father and son?</font>

180
00:12:53,910 --> 00:12:56,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then that guy over there
tried to bully me!</font>

181
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?!</font>

182
00:13:00,750 --> 00:13:03,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When that happened,
this guy here rescued me...</font>

183
00:13:04,260 --> 00:13:06,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He clashed with that monster...</font>

184
00:13:06,550 --> 00:13:09,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pretty interesting guy.</font>

185
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:13,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

186
00:13:20,690 --> 00:13:25,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kid... I recognize you
as my henchman...</font>

187
00:13:25,950 --> 00:13:30,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I'll show you what duty
and respect means!</font>

188
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:52,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make you pay the price
good and proper, you underling!</font>

189
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:59,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang on tight!</font>

190
00:14:05,900 --> 00:14:08,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How's that?!</font>

191
00:14:14,910 --> 00:14:16,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Awesome...</font>

192
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:40,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a guy...</font>

193
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:41,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's so heavy,</font>

194
00:14:41,900 --> 00:14:44,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could barely manage to
thrust my dagger through him.</font>

195
00:14:44,900 --> 00:14:46,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I don't hurry up,</font>

196
00:14:46,610 --> 00:14:48,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this battle will change
the shape of the landscape.</font>

197
00:14:49,530 --> 00:14:51,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey! Chief!</font>

198
00:14:51,450 --> 00:14:54,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan is over that way,
so don't move that way!</font>

199
00:14:54,790 --> 00:14:57,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please lure him in this direction.</font>

200
00:14:57,580 --> 00:14:59,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan...?</font>

201
00:14:59,750 --> 00:15:02,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's his girlfriend, Pop.</font>

202
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:04,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got to take that guy down.</font>

203
00:15:05,090 --> 00:15:07,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Otherwise, I won't be able
to rescue Sakura-chan!</font>

204
00:15:10,550 --> 00:15:12,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Interesting!</font>

205
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:16,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is interesting!
Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

206
00:15:16,850 --> 00:15:18,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This isn't good!</font>

207
00:15:18,810 --> 00:15:21,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Gaara...
He's intending to do that thing.</font>

208
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I better get out of here!</font>

209
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:39,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...? That is...</font>

210
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:44,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... the medium...?</font>

211
00:15:45,290 --> 00:15:48,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To thank you for entertaining me
up to now...</font>

212
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:53,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll show you the real power...</font>

213
00:15:53,390 --> 00:15:55,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the Sand Spirit!</font>

214
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:58,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The circles under his eyes...</font>

215
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:02,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are symptoms of
insomnia which indicate</font>

216
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:06,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that the medium is also possessed
by the Shukaku of the Sand.</font>

217
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:08,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Insomnia...?</font>

218
00:16:10,490 --> 00:16:13,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who are possessed
by the Demon Raccoon Shukaku</font>

219
00:16:13,820 --> 00:16:18,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are unable to sleep soundly
through the entire night.</font>

220
00:16:18,790 --> 00:16:20,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of the terror...</font>

221
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:28,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If one sleeps, Shukaku will slowly
eat away at their personality</font>

222
00:16:28,170 --> 00:16:32,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and eventually that person
is no longer himself.</font>

223
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because he normally
doesn't get much sleep...</font>

224
00:16:38,470 --> 00:16:43,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the medium's personality
tends to... become unstable.</font>

225
00:16:45,350 --> 00:16:46,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

226
00:16:48,190 --> 00:16:52,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, usually while
the medium is awake,</font>

227
00:16:52,530 --> 00:16:56,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the power of Shukaku is
normally controlled.</font>

228
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:58,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

229
00:17:00,870 --> 00:17:04,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when that medium sleeps...</font>

230
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:06,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Playing Possum Jutsu!</font>

231
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:20,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's done it...!</font>

232
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:24,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's gonna happen, Chief?</font>

233
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:29,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If one sets Playing Possum Jutsu
into motion...</font>

234
00:17:29,150 --> 00:17:31,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...the Shukaku will appear!</font>

235
00:17:38,070 --> 00:17:42,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm finally able to emerge!</font>

236
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:46,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the Shukaku?</font>

237
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:48,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's pretty funky...</font>

238
00:17:50,630 --> 00:17:55,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right away!
The guy I wanna kill! You!</font>

239
00:17:56,930 --> 00:17:58,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna jump...</font>

240
00:17:58,340 --> 00:17:59,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

241
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:02,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wind Style: Air Bullets!</font>

242
00:18:05,140 --> 00:18:07,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Style: Water Bullets!</font>

243
00:18:16,650 --> 00:18:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's practically a storm...</font>

244
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:22,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of a battle is this...?!</font>

245
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:28,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chief! I told you,
not in that direction!</font>

246
00:18:28,170 --> 00:18:31,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! I know!</font>

247
00:18:32,750 --> 00:18:34,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Air Bullets!</font>

248
00:18:35,210 --> 00:18:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Bullets!</font>

249
00:18:40,090 --> 00:18:41,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad...</font>

250
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:43,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't good, Chief!
There's one shot left...!</font>

251
00:18:52,650 --> 00:18:54,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! I killed it...</font>

252
00:18:54,610 --> 00:18:56,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I killed it!</font>

253
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:02,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That hurts...!</font>

254
00:19:03,030 --> 00:19:04,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare you shoot me</font>

255
00:19:04,620 --> 00:19:07,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with bullets containing
stupid amounts of Chakra!</font>

256
00:19:07,950 --> 00:19:11,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even I can't take that many shots!</font>

257
00:19:11,710 --> 00:19:13,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do?!</font>

258
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:18,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a start,
wake up that medium kid!</font>

259
00:19:19,130 --> 00:19:20,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will release that Jutsu!</font>

260
00:19:20,430 --> 00:19:22,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How do we go about waking him?!</font>

261
00:19:22,090 --> 00:19:25,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give him a good punch!</font>

262
00:19:26,850 --> 00:19:28,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Bullets!</font>

263
00:19:28,850 --> 00:19:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I'll take that!</font>

264
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

265
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chief, I can't hit him
unless you hold him down!</font>

266
00:19:48,080 --> 00:19:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Toad doesn't have fangs or claws
to hold that guy's movement.</font>

267
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:56,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do then?!</font>

268
00:19:56,290 --> 00:20:00,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll use the Transform Jutsu to
change into something that has those!</font>

269
00:20:02,430 --> 00:20:03,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But with that said...</font>

270
00:20:03,550 --> 00:20:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not particularly good
at transformations.</font>

271
00:20:06,510 --> 00:20:07,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

272
00:20:07,390 --> 00:20:12,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you will act as my will
and make the Sign!</font>

273
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:13,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

274
00:20:13,730 --> 00:20:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Time for a combined transformation!</font>

275
00:20:15,730 --> 00:20:17,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... Okay!</font>

276
00:20:17,770 --> 00:20:20,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We got to have fangs and claws!</font>

277
00:20:20,780 --> 00:20:22,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm...</font>

278
00:20:22,650 --> 00:20:24,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

279
00:20:25,370 --> 00:20:27,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait...
Hey, w-wait a second...!</font>

280
00:20:28,790 --> 00:20:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">F-Fangs and claws... Fangs and claws...
Fangs and claws!</font>

281
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:35,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

282
00:20:41,420 --> 00:20:42,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform Jutsu!</font>

283
00:20:50,180 --> 00:20:51,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the...!</font>

284
00:21:09,590 --> 00:21:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">gaman no renzoku dattaro</font></font></b></font>

285
00:21:09,590 --> 00:21:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a cycle of hardship, right?</font></font></b></font>

286
00:21:14,550 --> 00:21:19,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kokoro de naiteita ndarou</font></font></b></font>

287
00:21:14,550 --> 00:21:19,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">inside, we were crying, right?</font></font></b></font>

288
00:21:19,600 --> 00:21:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">jibun de kimeta sono yume dake wa yuzurenai ndarou</font></font></b></font>

289
00:21:19,600 --> 00:21:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but the one thing we won't give up is the dream we've chosen, right?</font></font></b></font>

290
